{"id":"n25372-1-8","stage":5,"title":"과다 · 过多","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n25372-1-8-1","ko":"이번 달은 지출 과다로 돈이 매우 부족해.","zh":"这个月因为支出太多，钱非常不够。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이번","meaning":"这次，这回","explanation":"이번：这次，这回。","readings":[{"term":"이번","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29737","senseId":"1","lemma":"이번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이번","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3"}},{"text":"달은","meaning":"月","explanation":"달：月；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"달","audio":"/audio/2f941e6eb2150679c43f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62266","senseId":"2","lemma":"달","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"달은","audio":"/audio/2f96d8959093a614484a.mp3"}},{"text":"지출","meaning":"支出","explanation":"지출：支出。","readings":[{"term":"지출","audio":"/audio/1ed4f1ad1c21e9b65d0d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28941","senseId":"1","lemma":"지출","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지출","audio":"/audio/1ed4f1ad1c21e9b65d0d.mp3"}},{"text":"과다로","meaning":"过多，过量","explanation":"과다：过多，过量；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"과다","audio":"/audio/216eacabf5b8f8d3339a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"25372","senseId":"1","lemma":"과다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"과다로","audio":"/audio/c6d403118c7a3bc37919.mp3"}},{"text":"돈이","meaning":"钱，金钱，钱币","explanation":"돈：钱，金钱，钱币；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"돈","audio":"/audio/a5d79d1c3005908084a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17204","senseId":"1","lemma":"돈","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"돈이","audio":"/audio/6fc43b50168ec9dd1ba6.mp3"}},{"text":"매우","meaning":"非常，极其，很","explanation":"매우：非常，极其，很。","readings":[{"term":"매우","audio":"/audio/6226ddde2c49b372f0a1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61510","senseId":"1","lemma":"매우","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceRe